# Keep deployments small: the Go function embeds what it needs; rasters never ship.
#
# Directory patterns are anchored to the repository root with a leading slash.
# An unanchored name matches at every depth (gitignore rules): a bare "data"
# would also remove src/data and break the build. scripts/vercel-check.mjs
# enforces this and checks that nothing the build needs is excluded.
/node_modules
/dist
/data
/screenshots
/tests
/docs
/tools
/artifacts
/.scratch
*.tif
*.tiff
*_test.go
.venv*
